# Purpose
Explains how to write useful tasks with clear titles, outcomes, owners, and
simple statuses.

# Key Sections
- What makes a good task.
- Write clear task titles.
- Define the outcome.
- Assign one owner.
- Use simple statuses.

# Dependencies
- Belongs to the productivity manual set.

# Gotchas
- Avoid assigning ownership or status without evidence from the user or source
  material.

